Module errands "Two errands in a yard" {
  Place yard "the yard" is room.
  Place lane "the lane" is room.
  Passage gate "the yard gate" is gate between yard and lane.
  Company party "You" of 1 at yard.
  Person halm "Teodor Halm" at yard { Role "a scholar". Peaceable. Pronouns he. }
  Entity road: fact "Where the road goes". Entity ringplace: fact "Where the ring was lost".
  Topic road with halm "Ask Halm where the road goes" when not knows(actor, road) {
    Says "'Down the lane, and on to the sea,' says Halm.".
    On discuss { Assert knows(actor, road). }
  }
  Topic ring with halm "Ask Halm where he lost his ring" when not knows(actor, ringplace) {
    Says "'By the yard gate, the day it rained,' says Halm.".
    On discuss { Assert knows(actor, ringplace). }
  }
  Objective walk when not been(party, lane) toward lane "Walk down the lane.".
  Objective ring when not knows(party, ringplace) toward halm "Halm has lost a ring, and would know where.".
  Observe yard_scene at yard when true "A yard, and a scholar at a barrow.".
  Goal false.
}
